      {id:"m-c3", prompt:"If one process has an error rate of 1 in 10^3 and another 1 in 10^6, how many times more accurate is the second on the log scale?", options:["3 orders of magnitude","2 orders of magnitude","6 orders of magnitude"], answer:"3 orders of magnitude"}
