      {id:"m-c2", prompt:"Which comparison best shows the inverse relationship?", options:["N triple bond (945) is shorter and stronger than C-C single bond (347)","H-H (436) and C-H (413) are nearly identical","O=O (498) is longer than N triple bond"], answer:"N triple bond (945) is shorter and stronger than C-C single bond (347)"}
