          {id:"h1-c2", prompt:"What was one major criticism of Reagan's economic policies?", options:["The national debt tripled as spending outpaced revenue", "Unemployment never fell during his presidency", "Taxes were raised on every American"], answer:"The national debt tripled as spending outpaced revenue"},
          {id:"h1-c3", prompt:"What did the 1986 Anti-Drug Abuse Act create?", options:["Harsh mandatory sentences with a 100-to-1 crack-to-powder disparity", "Legalization of marijuana nationwide", "An end to all federal drug laws"], answer:"Harsh mandatory sentences with a 100-to-1 crack-to-powder disparity"}
